{"synopsis":"Mahasiswa Xing Ye mendapatkan kemampuan untuk mengambil alih tubuh orang lain dengan tingkat keberhasilan 100%. Namun, secara kebetulan, ia malah mengambil alih tubuh seorang necromancer. Ternyata, necromancer ini adalah pemilik dari sebuah sistem, dan karena sistem inilah dia menjadi mayat setelah kematiannya. Sistem ini memberikan misi bunuh diri tanpa memperhatikan kemampuan sang pemilik tubuh, tetapi Xing Ye merasa bahwa sistem bunuh diri ini justru cocok dengannya sekarang karena ia sudah menjadi mayat. “Hahaha, aku sudah mati, apa lagi yang perlu kutakuti?”","alternative_title":"Wo Duo Shele Xitong Wanjia, I Took Over the System Players,","author":"youth小勇","artist":"youth小勇","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"5a217a4c-00e7-4c07-ac08-288d62aa1290","number":"170","chapter":"170","title":"","date":"2026-06-24","released":"2026-06-24","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_8759148c-29b3-403e-a5b4-3006398d97e5/chapter_ch_170/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_8759148c-29b3-403e-a5b4-3006398d97e5/chapter_ch_170/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_8759148c-29b3-403e-a5b4-3006398d97e5/chapter_ch_170/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_8759148c-29b3-403e-a5b4-3006398d97e5/chapter_ch_170/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_8759148c-29b3-403e-a5b4-3006398d97e5/chapter_ch_170/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_8759148c-29b3-403e-a5b4-3006398d97e5/chapter_ch_170/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_8759148c-29b3-403e-a5b4-3006398d97e5/chapter_ch_170/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_8759148c-29b3-403e-a5b4-3006398d97e5/chapter_ch_170/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_8759148c-29b3-403e-a5b4-3006398d97e5/chapter_ch_170/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_8759148c-29b3-403e-a5b4-3006398d97e5/chapter_ch_170/10.webp"]},{"chapter_id":"7cc8c0f2-1a27-41c4-9a82-3595fa980bfd","number":"169","chapter":"169","title":"","date":"2026-05-28","released":"2026-05-28","im